---
permalink: /comments-posts.json
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#- Every post that exists — a contract with the comments worker, which reads
    it weekly and deletes comments of posts that have gone (after a 30-day
    grace period and an email: a renamed post looks like a deleted one). Kept
    separate from search.json, which is large and belongs to search.

    Raw page.url values, not run through HtmlBasePlugin (it only rewrites
    HTML), so they match the data-post value comments.js sends. Keep it so. -#}
[
{%- for post in collections.posts %}
  {{ post.url | dump | safe }}{{ "," if not loop.last }}
{%- endfor %}
]
